text:
Mia Wang: Quick design check: we're regrouping sidebar items (Models, Datasets, Experiments) into a Workspace cluster. If a user lands via deep link with compact nav, do we show a tiny breadcrumb or just highlight the cluster title? seeing weird filter resets with the short query links :thinking_face:
Omar Khan: I vote for a compact breadcrumb (single row) that shows Workspace > Section > Item. If space is tight, collapse workspace to an icon + tooltip. Must persist workspace filter in route hydration.
Jamie Lee: Can we pick a canonical route format so server logs and permalinks are consistent? Suggest `/w/:ws/<section>/<id>` as canonical, and accept `/section/:id?ws=` as legacy. Client should rewrite query-form to path-form on first paint.
Nora Patel: Accessibility: compact breadcrumb needs a `nav` landmark, each crumb should be tabbable, active crumb gets `aria-current=\"page\"`, and truncated crumb must expose `aria-label`. Tooltips are desktop-only; on mobile long-press open an accessible sheet.
Mia Wang: UX nuance: when sidebar is grouped (Workspace cluster collapsed), highlight cluster label and show a one-line breadcrumb above content. If cluster expanded, show full nav and hide the breadcrumb to reduce redundancy.
Jamie Lee: Router migration snippet (tiny):
```
// on init
if (location.search.includes('ws=') && location.pathname.startsWith('/models/')) {
  const p = new URLSearchParams(location.search);
  const ws = p.get('ws');
  const id = location.pathname.split('/').pop();
  history.replaceState({}, '', `/w/${ws}/models/${id}` + location.search);
  analytics.track('rewrite_ws_to_path');
}
```
Omar Khan: Also handle legacy hash panels: if `#panel=` present, move to `?panel=` and emit `legacy_hash_migrated`. Avoid keeping UI-only state in path segments.
design-bot: Draft spec added: https://redwood.design/ux/sidebar-cluster-breadcrumbs  includes canary plan and a11y checklist.
Nora Patel: Microcopy: action in mobile sheet should read "Open parent workspace". Add visible label "Show path" for screen readers on the breadcrumb toggle. Ensure focus ring meets contrast.
Mia Wang: Ieefed up mocks for collapsed/expanded cluster + compact breadcrumb states and put three width variants (320/375/768). Will post frames soon. Thanks! :sparkles:
